            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    To Lucius Volcacius Primus, son of Quintus, of tribe Velina, prefect of the 1st cohort Noricorum in Pannonia, prefect of the Danube bank and of the
                    two communities of the Boii and the Azali, military tribune of the 5th legion Macedonicae in Moeisa, prefect of Ala I Pannoniorum in Africa,
                    quinquennial duovir, flamen of all the gods, patron of the colony. This was set up in accordance with his will, when Marcus Accius Seneca and [-] Manlius Planta
                    were quinquennial duovirs. This place was given by decree of the decurions.
                </p>
